#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"Could not send \"%(name)s\" because its parent, %(parent)s, was deleted from"
" WooCommerce. What Odoo sends to WooCommerce should not be deleted. For each"
" record it sends, Odoo keeps one link per language. Delete in Odoo all the "
"language links of the parent: Odoo will create it again in WooCommerce the "
"next time it sends this record. If you do not want the parent in "
"WooCommerce, change the parent of this record in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido enviar «%(name)s» porque su padre, %(parent)s, se ha borrado"
" de WooCommerce. Lo que Odoo envía a WooCommerce no se debería borrar. Por "
"cada registro que envía, Odoo guarda un enlace por idioma. Borre en Odoo "
"todos los enlaces de los idiomas del padre: Odoo lo volverá a crear en "
"WooCommerce la próxima vez que envíe este registro. Si no quiere el padre en"
" WooCommerce, cambie en Odoo el padre de este registro."

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"Could not update %s because it was deleted from WooCommerce. What Odoo sends"
" to WooCommerce should not be deleted. For each record it sends, Odoo keeps "
"one link per language. As long as the language links of this record exist, "
"every update from Odoo will fail. If you really do not want it in "
"WooCommerce, delete in Odoo all the language links of this record: if one "
"remains, Odoo will keep trying. If no product uses it, Odoo will not send it"
" again; if a product uses it, now or some day, it will go back to "
"WooCommerce when that product is exported."
msgstr ""
"No se ha podido actualizar %s porque se ha borrado de WooCommerce. Lo que "
"Odoo envía a WooCommerce no se debería borrar. Por cada registro que envía, "
"Odoo guarda un enlace por idioma. Mientras existan los enlaces de los "
"idiomas de este registro, cada vez que Odoo lo actualice, fallará. Si "
"realmente no lo quiere en WooCommerce, borre en Odoo todos los enlaces de "
"los idiomas de este registro: si queda alguno, Odoo lo seguirá intentando. "
"Si ningún producto lo usa, Odoo ya no lo volverá a enviar; si un producto lo"
" usa, ahora o algún día, volverá a WooCommerce cuando se exporte ese "
"producto."

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid "Error connecting to WooCommerce: %s"
msgstr "Error de conexión a WooCommerce: %s"

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"Error decoding json WooCommerce response: %(error)s\n"
"Args:%(args)s\n"
"Kwargs:%(kwargs)s\n"
"URL:%(url)s\n"
"Headers:%(headers)s\n"
"Method:%(method)s\n"
"Body:%(body)s"
msgstr ""
"Error al decodificar la respuesta json de WooCommerce: %(error)s\n"
"Args:%(args)s\n"
"Kwargs:%(kwargs)s\n"
"URL:%(url)s\n"
"Headers:%(headers)s\n"
"Método:%(method)s\n"
"Cuerpo:%(body)s"

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"Error: %(data)s -> Op: %(op)s, Resource: %(resource)s, Args: %(args)s, "
"KWArgs: %(kwargs)s"
msgstr ""
"Error: %(data)s -> Op: %(op)s, Recurso: %(resource)s, Args: %(args)s, "
"KWArgs: %(kwargs)s"

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"Error: '%(message)s'. Probably repeated record already exists in Woocommerce. If you don't see it from the interface probably the database is dirty and you should check the database directly. It means that there's terms (value attributes) in table wp_term_taxonomy with a non-existent taxonomy (attribute).\n"
"Please, review the data in %(resource)s/%(resource_id)s and compare it with %(data)s"
msgstr ""
"Error: '%(message)s'. Probablemente el registro repetido ya existe en Woocommerce. Si no lo ve desde la interfaz, probablemente la base de datos está sucia y debería revisarla directamente. Significa que hay términos (valores de atributo) en la tabla wp_term_taxonomy con una taxonomía (atributo) que no existe.\n"
"Por favor, revise los datos en %(resource)s/%(resource_id)s y compárelos con %(data)s"

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"Error: '%(message)s'. Probably the %(resource)s has been removed from "
"Woocommerce. If it's the case, try to remove the binding of the %(model)s."
msgstr ""
"Error: '%(message)s'. Probablemente el %(resource)s ha sido eliminado de "
"Woocommerce. Si es el caso, intente eliminar el enlace del %(model)s."

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid "The '%(header)s' header is missing in multi responses: %(response)s"
msgstr ""
"Falta la cabecera '%(header)s' en las respuestas múltiples: %(response)s"

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"The '%(header)s' header should not be present in singleton responses: "
"%(response)s"
msgstr ""
"La cabecera '%(header)s' no debería aparecer en las respuestas de un solo "
"registro: %(response)s"

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"The 'offset' and 'page' parameters are incompatible in WooCommerce API "
"calls. Please, use only one of them."
msgstr ""
"Los parámetros 'offset' y 'page' son incompatibles en las llamadas a la API "
"de WooCommerce. Por favor, use solo uno de ellos."

#. module: connector_extension_woocommerce
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/connector_extension_woocommerce/components/adapter.py:0
msgid ""
"The 'per_page' parameter is managed automatically in WooCommerce API calls. "
"Do not use it in the domain."
msgstr ""
"El parámetro 'per_page' se gestiona automáticamente en las llamadas a la API"
" de WooCommerce. No lo use en el dominio."

